Z||000003||Standard||08-29-2001||02:50 AM||||ummm... that's not rice.  It'll out-accelerate and out-handle quite a few Fiero's (if not most) here.<P>Just a reminder..<P>"rice" is advertising something you don't have, and thinking you're faster because of it.  i.e. VTEC stickers on a civic DX, or.. say.. a "Suspension by Lotus" sticker on a Fiero  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">        <BR>1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed<P><FONT SIZE="1">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto<BR><FONT COLOR="red">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
